1
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:36,000
I am a man. If a girl has
to sacrifice her body to save me,

2
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,000
I'd rather die in jail!

3
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,400
What?

4
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,400
Why did you deal me a blow?

5
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:45,600
You can't even beat me, let alone
the guards at the magistrate's

6
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:47,600
You'll only be courting
your own death!

7
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:49,800
Even if I die, I'll still go there!

8
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Stay right there!
Were you a mule in your past life?

9
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,600
You're so thick in the head

10
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:59,000
Won't you be letting Shuangxi down
if you go get yourself killed?

11
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,400
She put her chastity
at stake for you

12
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:05,800
Fu, listen to me.
I've got everything arranged

13
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:08,000
Shuangxi will be able
to make her escape

14
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:11,600
Wait here for her.
She'll join you shortly

15
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,400
It's all my fault

16
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:18,600
If it weren't for me, Shuangxi
wouldn't have to sacrifice herself

17
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:25,600
Come on, Shuangxi is only pretending
to marry that wretched Shi Yaoqian

18
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:29,200
I promise you
he won't lay a finger on her

19
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:41,000
My dear, sorry to keep you waiting

20
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:47,600
My dear, why did you blow out
the candles?

21
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:52,000
You must be getting impatient.
I am coming, my dear

22
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,800
I am coming

23
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,400
Who are you?!

24
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:05,200
Big Mouth Su, how come it's you?

25
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:10,600
I... I have no idea either.
I was still helping out outside

26
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:14,000
Then someone put me in a sack
and brought me here

27
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:16,400
What! I've just kissed you!

28
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:23,000
That wretched woman set me up!

29
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,000
Men!

30
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,000
Madam!

31
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:31,000
Stop calling her Madam!

32
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:34,400
That wretched woman has run away!
Give chase!

33
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:38,000
You've got to answer for
your actions

34
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:41,000
-Yeah, right
-You molested me!

35
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,600
You molested me

36
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:51,400
Why aren't they here yet?
Something must have happened

37
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,400
I must go to their rescue!

38
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:55,400
Trust me for once

39
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,600
Don't be anxious

40
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:09,000
Fu, how long have you
stayed in Ping'an Town?

41
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,600
From the day I was born

42
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:15,600
Ever thought of going away
to strike it out on your own?

43
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:16,800
No

44
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:20,000
Then it's time
to start thinking about it

45
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,000
Why?

46
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:26,400
Do you think you and Shuangxi
can still stay in Ping'an?

47
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:29,000
That's right!
Why didn't it occur to me?

48
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:33,000
After what's happened, Shuangxi and I
won't be able to stay here any longer

49
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:37,000
That's why you must leave tonight.
Go as far away as possible

50
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:40,600
-What about Shou and Lu?
-Shou already knows about it

51
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:43,000
I'll break it to Lu when he returns

52
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,600
I believe he'll give you his blessing

53
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:49,000
-That's true
-Brother Fuqi!

54
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:51,400
Shuangxi!

55
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:58,000
-Did Shi Yaoqian bully you?
-No, he didn't

56
00:04:58,200 --> 00:05:00,000
He did nothing

57
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:05,400
We finally got away to safety

58
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:09,000
But Shi Yaoqian must have
discovered the swap

59
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:11,000
Let him fret all he wants

60
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,400
Brother, Sis-in-law,
you should leave this place now

61
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:17,600
-What did you call me?
-We called you Sis-in-law

62
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:29,200
-The guards have given chase here
-Leave. We'll lure them away

63
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:32,400
Be careful

64
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:40,400
-What shall we do?
-Fu, take Shuangxi away

65
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:43,200
Remember, go as far away as you can

66
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:46,200
Do more good deeds in future.
Be a good man

67
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:49,000
-What about you?
-I'll be fine. Leave now

68
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,000
-Go on
-Thanks. Let's go

69
00:05:58,400 --> 00:06:00,400
Stay right there!

70
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:03,400
-Ma Ruyi, you planned this!
-So?

71
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:07,000
Magistrate Shi wants Wu Fuqi and
Yu Shuangxi arrested. Stay away!

72
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:11,400
Cut the crap! I've also been tasked
by so-and-so to protect them

73
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:13,000
You'll have to get past me!

74
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,200
Ma Ruyi, how dare you trick me!

75
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,600
Ma Ruyi, stay right there!

76
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:41,000
It worked!
Take three steps back

77
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:51,600
Magistrate Shi was right.
You're under the Obedience Spell

78
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:54,400
You shall destroy your own skills!

79
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:03,400
Fool! The spell only
lasts for a moment

80
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:17,600
Shuangxi, hurry up!

81
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,600
I can't go on anymore

82
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:38,200
Shuangxi, we'll take a breather here.
They won't catch up with us so soon

83
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,800
Fireflies!

84
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:53,000
Shuangxi, we're so blessed. Even
the fireflies are watching over us

85
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:04,800
Shuangxi, run!

86
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:28,400
Bookworm, what are you writing?

87
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:30,000
Don't disturb me

88
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:36,600
You're writing all these revolting
and disgusting lines!

89
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,400
I'm going to tell my master!

90
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:45,400
What do you mean by disgusting lines?
It's a love poem for Her Highness!

91
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:50,200
Since you're here,
let me read it out to you

92
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,000
-Tell me what you think
-I'm not hearing it!

93
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:58,600
The bird sings on the tree branch;
the man recites alone below the light

94
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:05,000
The romantic poem he reads
speaks of his lovesickness

95
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:10,600
What do you think?

96
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:13,000
Master, the bookworm is
engaging in queer writing!

97
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:18,000
That's no queer writing. It's
different from Buddhist scriptures

98
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,600
It's a love poem!

99
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:23,400
Bookworm, ever since
you came to the temple,

100
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,400
you've not sat down to read a book

101
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:28,200
The examination is tomorrow.
Do you think you can top the cohort?

102
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:34,400
When I was your age, I'd already
studied the 4 Books and 5 Classics

103
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,400
I knew them like the back of my hand

104
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:39,000
Who else but I will be
the top scholar?

105
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:43,200
Those who study at the eleventh hour
aren't fit to be top scholars

106
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:46,000
-Understand?
-Master!

107
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:51,400
Come back! There's something
I want to tell you

108
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:53,600
I need a favour from you

109
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:57,000
Is that how you ask a favour of me?

110
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:04,400
I want you to deliver the love poem
to Her Highness

111
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:07,600
-Will you do it?
-Do I have another option?

112
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:17,600
Make way!

113
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:22,000
Fresh vegetables

114
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:27,400
Sirs, be gentler. Are you here
to buy vegetables?

115
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:31,600
-These greens are very fresh
-We're here to make an arrest

116
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:39,800
That's true. Robbery and theft
have been rife in Ping'an Town

117
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:45,600
Drop the act. Your sister, Yu Shuangxi,
and Wu Fuqi have run away

118
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:49,600
Until we arrest them,
life won't be easy for you

119
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:52,800
Confiscate the vegetables!

120
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:57,600
Don't take my vegetables away

121
00:10:58,400 --> 00:11:01,200
A bunch of scoundrels!
Come back!

122
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:03,800
You're too much!
You stole my goods!

123
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:07,200
Veg-seller, you're enjoying
a brisk business

124
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:09,400
I'd like to buy some greens from you

125
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:14,000
Just my luck to have met you
and your family!

126
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:19,000
What's eating you?
Yu Daxi, come here!

127
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:21,000
I'm not done with you yet

128
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:24,600
Did I offend you or what?

129
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:28,600
Why are you taking it out on me?

130
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:34,200
You jolly well know my vegetables
get seized every day

131
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:38,400
Then file an appeal at the yamen.
What has it got to do with me?

132
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:40,800
It's all thanks to your son!

133
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:44,200
I'm suffering the consequences
of his actions

134
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:48,200
Return me my sister and we shall draw
the line between our families

135
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,880
Don't get me implicated

136
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:55,600
Now you're blaming us.
It's your sister who seduced my son

137
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:58,000
I've yet to settle
that score with you!

138
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:00,800
Everyone in this town knows
what a character your son is

139
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:03,600
He's even landed my sister in trouble

140
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:06,400
He's a toad lusting after
swan's flesh

141
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:09,400
That's a novel statement
coming from you

142
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:13,800
Would two sisters who grew up
in poverty be swan material?

143
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:15,800
What a joke!

144
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:19,800
Listen, everyone!

145
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:23,000
The madwoman is spouting nonsense

146
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:27,600
-Who are you calling a madwoman?
-That's you!

147
00:12:29,400 --> 00:12:32,000
-How dare you kick me
-I like it

148
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:35,400
Come here, shrew!

149
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,400
Madwoman!

150
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:42,400
Give it to me!

151
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:46,000
That's for calling me a madwoman!

152
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:56,400
Stay right there!

153
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,200
Stop fighting

154
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:22,000
Sir, what brings you here?

155
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:25,080
-I'm here to see Ruyi
-Ruyi?

156
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:31,400
I see...
Ruyi!

157
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:35,000
Here's the "ruyi"
(a jade symbol of good luck)

158
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:42,000
-Is this some kind of trick?
-No, it's not

159
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:44,800
That's a genuine jade article

160
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:50,400
Ma Ruyi works for the yamen

161
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:54,600
But she abducted the magistrate's
bride and released a convict

162
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:57,000
Execution awaits her

163
00:13:57,400 --> 00:14:00,000
-But that's our "ruyi"
-Search the place!

164
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:03,800
Don't search the place

165
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:08,400
-Sir, you wanted a "ruyi"
-Shut your trap

166
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:12,000
-Where's your sickly son?
-He...

167
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:14,800
He's gone out!

168
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:18,800
-He's in big trouble
-He always gets into trouble

169
00:14:18,800 --> 00:14:23,600
He's always hanging out with Ma Ruyi,
so he's just as guilty

170
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:26,600
Sir, my son has nothing
to do with it

171
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:29,000
-She's nowhere to be found
-Heard that?

172
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:34,000
If I find you in cahoots with
Ma Ruyi, you'll lose your heads

173
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:36,000
Sir, our...

174
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:41,400
Return us our family's "ruyi"!

175
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:05,400
Is something troubling Your Highness?
You've been looking distracted

176
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:09,000
Father will be sending Xiaotian
as a foreign envoy

177
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:12,400
-I'd like to tag along
-Has Lord Yonghuan said no?

178
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:16,200
Would he dare say no? But he needs
Father's consent first

179
00:15:16,400 --> 00:15:18,600
No wonder you've been looking worried

180
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:22,600
You're worried His Majesty will stop
you from joining your betrothed

181
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:26,600
It's not that. But I hear the foreign
land boasts of an exotic scenery

182
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:30,600
When will Your Highness set off
if His Majesty grants permission?

183
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:32,600
Today, I think

184
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:37,600
Oh no! Today happens to be
the day of the Imperial Examination

185
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:40,400
What a coincidence

186
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:45,000
Young Master Wei sent a message,
asking to see Your Highness this day

187
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:47,400
Your presence will boost his chances
of topping the examination

188
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:51,600
He did suffer much to escort me
back to the Capital

189
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:54,800
Go get ready.
I'll call on him

190
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:01,000
One night-luminescent pearl,
two emerald Chinese cabbages,

191
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:05,400
300 taels of gold,
10,000 taels of silver...

192
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:07,400
Don't go on anymore

193
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:13,120
I didn't expect to spend a fortune on
the barbaric king's birthday

194
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:17,000
It's his first grand occasion
since he ascended the throne

195
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:19,000
We cannot dispense with the gifts

196
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:23,600
But the long list of gifts
may suggest that I'm afraid of him

197
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:26,000
All the more he'll get arrogant

198
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:33,000
Your Majesty, our country lacks
the resources to fight the barbarians

199
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:37,600
Would our vast country be intimidated
by a small barbaric state?

200
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:41,400
But the barbaric state
has gone from strength to strength

201
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:46,000
The marquises are disunited and
harbour personal agendas

202
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:49,200
-I'm afraid that...
-They'll exploit the opportunity?

203
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:54,200
That's correct, Your Majesty.
Please bear with the current situation

204
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:59,200
-How much longer?
-It will come to an end soon

205
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:02,600
Your Majesty has always placed
implicit trust in your subject

206
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:06,600
Your subject is willing to do
his utmost for Your Majesty

207
00:17:06,600 --> 00:17:09,200
I'm willing to establish
Your Majesty's reign

208
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:12,600
All right.
We'll follow your plan

209
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:15,400
Rest assured it'll go well

210
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:19,800
You'll be sending birthday greetings.
It's an important assignment

211
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:23,800
Don't you bring shame to your mission
and the Imperial Court

212
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,400
Yes, Your Majesty

213
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:30,200
Your Majesty, your subject
has another request

214
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:31,600
Speak

215
00:17:31,600 --> 00:17:35,200
Allow Princess Ruining to join
your subject on the mission

216
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:39,400
Absurd! A princess sending birthday
greetings to a barbaric king?

217
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:41,400
It'll become the butt of jokes

218
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:47,000
Don't be angry, Your Majesty.
Your subject has thought it over

219
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:51,200
I, Lord Yonghuan, may be a marquis,
but I'm not royalty

220
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:54,600
However, if Her Highness
travels with me,

221
00:17:54,600 --> 00:17:59,000
she'll represent the royal family and
show that the king is held in high esteem

222
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:02,400
The people will also realize
how great Your Majesty is

223
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:06,000
Enough said

224
00:18:06,400 --> 00:18:08,600
I see your point

225
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:14,000
But it'll be an arduous journey
with sandstorms

226
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:18,600
Will the sheltered princess
be able to take the journey?

227
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:23,000
Let me think it over

228
00:18:31,680 --> 00:18:34,600
Young Master Wei, any idea
about the examination topic?

229
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:39,400
It's virtues, heaven and Tao
from Doctrine of the Mean

230
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:42,800
-Tao, virtues and heaven?
-That's right

231
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:46,000
-Brother Wei...
-Tao, virtues and heaven

232
00:18:48,600 --> 00:18:51,600
-Young Master Wei...
-Tao, virtues and heaven

233
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:54,000
-Brother Wei...
-Tao, virtues and heaven

234
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:01,600
Did Father say I could join you?

235
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:05,200
-His Majesty...
-He said no?

236
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:07,400
Your father had a point there

237
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:12,000
Not only will it be a long journey, the
weather fluctuations will also be great

238
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,600
He's worried about your well-being

239
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:15,600
But you'll be there with me

240
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:19,600
Since he won't let me go,
I shall make the trip secretly!

241
00:19:19,600 --> 00:19:22,000
Please don't do that, Your Highness

242
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:25,400
If His Majesty learns about it,
my head will roll

243
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:28,200
I can make your head roll too!

244
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:32,000
Won't it break your heart?
Stop putting me on a spot

245
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:34,400
I'll talk to Father then

246
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:39,200
Your Highness! His Majesty was
against the idea initially

247
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:41,800
But he acceded after
I vouched for your safety

248
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:44,400
You tricked me!

249
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:47,200
It's getting late.
It's time we set off

250
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:49,400
-Now?
-Yes. Do you have something on?

251
00:19:50,600 --> 00:19:53,600
Your Highness!
Your Highness, we may leave now

252
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:55,600
-Your Lordship
-Where are you going?

253
00:19:55,600 --> 00:19:59,000
We'll be cheering Young Master Wei on
at the Imperial Examination

254
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:04,600
Hongying, you go ahead.
I'll be leaving with the marquis

255
00:20:04,600 --> 00:20:07,600
-Yes, Your Highness
-Hongying, come back

256
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:11,200
Let us lend him our support
at the examination hall

257
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:13,000
You don't mind it?

258
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:16,000
Why should I when Your Highness
has put my feelings first?

259
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:19,000
Besides, I also agree that
Wei Delu is a man of talent

260
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:22,400
It'll be a good thing if he tops
the examination and serves the court

261
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,600
Let's go

262
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:29,400
What are you doing? The candidates
have all gone inside

263
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:31,600
You'd better go in soon

264
00:20:31,600 --> 00:20:35,600
Hey, I'm talking to you.
It's you again

265
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:39,000
The cheek of you to come back here.
I may just throw you out

266
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:42,600
Did the Imperial Court specify
no repeat candidates?

267
00:20:42,600 --> 00:20:46,400
What's more, it's not time yet.
Why are you so anxious?

268
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:48,000
-You!
-Yes?

269
00:20:48,800 --> 00:20:50,000
Very well

270
00:21:29,600 --> 00:21:32,000
-Get Zha Daoguang here
-Yes

271
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:36,400
-Young Master Wei, I've kept you waiting
-It's all right

272
00:21:36,400 --> 00:21:39,000
I'm very happy to see you here

273
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:53,000
Young Master Wei,
are you feeling nervous?

274
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:56,400
Just do your usual best and
I'm sure you'll excel

275
00:21:56,400 --> 00:22:00,600
I'm not nervous. I must say
I do feel quite confident

276
00:22:00,800 --> 00:22:02,600
Greetings, Your Lordship

277
00:22:04,400 --> 00:22:05,400
Lord Zha

278
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:08,000
You've come with Her Highness?

279
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:09,600
So that man is Wei Delu

280
00:22:09,800 --> 00:22:13,600
I'm very happy that you came

281
00:22:14,600 --> 00:22:17,200
So he's a friend of Your Lordship?

282
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:19,600
He's Princess Ruining's friend

283
00:22:19,600 --> 00:22:23,800
Lord Zha, the Imperial Examination
seeks to recruit men of talent...

284
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:25,600
to serve His Majesty

285
00:22:25,600 --> 00:22:31,400
A pity many incompetent men will
try to masquerade as talent...

286
00:22:31,400 --> 00:22:33,600
during the selection process

287
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:37,400
So please take special care of him

288
00:22:37,600 --> 00:22:39,000
Take care of him?

289
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:41,000
Special care

290
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:44,680
I see. I'll take special care of him

291
00:22:48,800 --> 00:22:52,000
I'll be sending birthday greetings to
the barbaric king with Ouyang Xiaotian

292
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:54,000
I hope to hear good news
when I return

293
00:23:00,200 --> 00:23:03,000
Did His Majesty order you
to make the trip?

294
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:04,000
No

295
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:06,600
Ouyang Xiaotian forced you to go?

296
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:13,400
-Stop imagining things
-Ouyang Xiaotian cannot be trusted

297
00:23:13,400 --> 00:23:16,600
He deliberately made me
look bad in the Palace,

298
00:23:16,600 --> 00:23:18,400
putting Your Highness on a spot

299
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:22,600
-Ouyang Xiaotian cannot be trusted
-Don't read too much into things

300
00:23:22,600 --> 00:23:25,800
-Concentrate on the examination
-Your Highness...

301
00:23:25,800 --> 00:23:28,600
I hope you'll top the examination

302
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:32,000
-I should be going
-Your Highness

303
00:23:35,600 --> 00:23:36,600
Move

304
00:23:38,400 --> 00:23:40,400
Farewell, Your Highness

305
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:56,000
Young Master Wei, it's time
you entered the hall

306
00:24:13,400 --> 00:24:17,000
Father, bad news!
Bad news!

307
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:19,000
What's the commotion about?

308
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:24,000
I heard the candidates discussing
how Wei Delu tipped them off

309
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:27,600
He'd told them the examination topic
would touch on Tao, virtues and heaven

310
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:32,600
He's spot-on!

311
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:38,880
What! He'll certainly excel
in this examination, won't he?

312
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:41,200
Leave, all of you

313
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:44,600
What shall we do, Father?

314
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:51,400
The marquis has instructed me
to deal with that chap

315
00:24:51,400 --> 00:24:55,000
Should he top the examination,
how am I to answer to the marquis?

316
00:24:57,800 --> 00:25:02,000
Father, do not reveal
the examination topic just yet

317
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:04,600
Are you suggesting that...

318
00:25:05,400 --> 00:25:08,600
-Change the topic!
-Change the topic?

319
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:15,600
Candidates, today's topic is: why are
the masses so highly-esteemed?

320
00:25:15,800 --> 00:25:18,800
Your Lordship, isn't the topic about
Tao, virtues and heaven?

321
00:25:18,800 --> 00:25:21,400
Shut up!
Sit down

322
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:24,400
I'm the examiner.
I set the questions

323
00:25:24,400 --> 00:25:28,600
Get down to it. Your time is only
for as long as the joss-stick lasts

324
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:31,400
One joss-stick

325
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:34,000
Wait

326
00:25:34,800 --> 00:25:38,200
I've completed the essay

327
00:25:40,600 --> 00:25:43,000
Wei Delu, aren't you too fast

328
00:25:43,000 --> 00:25:45,000
You have neat handwriting

329
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:49,600
Wei Delu, you heard the topic wrongly

330
00:25:49,600 --> 00:25:53,600
It should be: what the masses
hold in high esteem

331
00:25:54,600 --> 00:25:57,000
Sit down, all of you!

332
00:25:58,000 --> 00:26:00,000
Quiet! You don't have much time left

333
00:26:00,800 --> 00:26:04,400
Stop your racket. There is only
half the joss-stick left

334
00:26:04,600 --> 00:26:07,400
-Start writing
-Wait

335
00:26:09,880 --> 00:26:11,400
I'm done

336
00:26:13,400 --> 00:26:16,200
Surely not?
Aren't you fast

337
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:19,000
You cheated, didn't you?

338
00:26:22,000 --> 00:26:25,000
Wei Delu, you got
the topic wrong again

339
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:28,400
It should have been: the masses
hold food in high esteem

340
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:31,800
Sit down!

341
00:26:34,600 --> 00:26:37,400
Sit down!
Or I'll hit you

342
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:43,600
Sit down and start writing.
Time is running out

343
00:26:43,600 --> 00:26:46,000
I'll be collecting your essays soon

344
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:47,600
Wait!

345
00:26:51,600 --> 00:26:53,600
Here you go

346
00:26:55,600 --> 00:26:59,200
You can't be serious!
Aren't you ridiculously fast

347
00:27:01,800 --> 00:27:06,600
Your Lordship, the joss-stick
is almost gone

348
00:27:06,800 --> 00:27:11,600
I also wrote the Everlasting Regret
when you were hitting a candidate

349
00:27:11,600 --> 00:27:13,600
It's for you

350
00:27:22,600 --> 00:27:27,600
A shallow pond inhibits
the greatness of a flood dragon

351
00:27:27,600 --> 00:27:33,200
At the break of dawn,
A high office awaits me

352
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:37,400
Excellent prose

353
00:27:39,400 --> 00:27:41,600
I should write it down

354
00:27:49,600 --> 00:27:52,800
Who wrote that?!
Who did?!

355
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:56,400
-I did. Why?
-That's graffiti

356
00:27:56,400 --> 00:28:00,000
Come on, that's calligraphy
by a top scholar

357
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:03,200
This wall shall become known as
the Top Scholar Wall

358
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:07,000
The wing I slept in shall be known
as the Top Scholar Wing

359
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:08,400
The cup and chair I used...

360
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:10,600
shall be known as
the Top Scholar Cup and Chair

361
00:28:10,600 --> 00:28:14,000
Braggart! What makes you think
you'll be the top scholar?

362
00:28:16,600 --> 00:28:20,200
Master!
Master, he hit me!

363
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:26,800
-Father, this is terrible!
-What is it now?

364
00:28:26,800 --> 00:28:29,600
Father, this essay is by
my cousin, Wang Xinxin

365
00:28:29,600 --> 00:28:33,800
-What about it? Read it to me
-Sit tight, Father

366
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:37,600
"Why do the masses hold food
in high esteem? Just ask me

367
00:28:37,600 --> 00:28:42,000
"I've always loved food.
I'll eat anything that's edible

368
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:46,000
"No delicacy from all parts of
the earth shall escape me

369
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:47,600
"Ha! Ha! Ha!
Impressive, eh?"

370
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:49,600
Father, there is more

371
00:28:49,600 --> 00:28:53,200
"Big bun, small bun, chicken meat
bun, sweet pork bun, lotus paste..."

372
00:28:53,600 --> 00:28:58,400
That's a terrible piece of work!

373
00:28:58,400 --> 00:29:02,000
That rascal!
He's a total disgrace

374
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:05,600
I'll be so embarrassed if people
find out I have such a nephew

375
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:10,400
But Wei Delu was able to write three
excellent essays within the same time

376
00:29:10,400 --> 00:29:13,600
He even found time to write
the Everlasting Regret for me

377
00:29:13,600 --> 00:29:15,400
Just read his essays!

378
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:21,600
"Ping'an Town in Luzhou has not had
any unusual phenomena for 100 years

379
00:29:21,600 --> 00:29:25,000
"The people live in peace
and prosperity

380
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:28,000
"In the spring of the 10th year,
a disaster struck in Ping'an..."

381
00:29:31,600 --> 00:29:36,200
Father, it's very well-written.
He'll surely be named the Top Scholar

382
00:29:36,800 --> 00:29:42,000
I'd wanted to leave him stumped
but he produced such a great essay

383
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:47,800
-Father, I've got an idea
-What do you suggest?

384
00:29:47,800 --> 00:29:50,000
Let's swap his essay with another's

385
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:53,400
Swap his essay with another's?

386
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:19,000
When will we reach the border?
The journey is killing me

387
00:30:19,400 --> 00:30:23,000
We'll get there in two hours' time

388
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:26,600
You've repeated that many times.
Just when will we get there?

389
00:30:26,600 --> 00:30:30,000
Well, you insisted on tagging along

390
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:36,600
All I see is snow everywhere.
How boring

391
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:40,000
We're reaching the border.
Bear with it

392
00:30:50,400 --> 00:30:53,000
No! I... I'd like to...

393
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:57,080
All right.
Halt!

394
00:31:07,600 --> 00:31:08,800
Be careful

395
00:31:13,800 --> 00:31:14,800
Hongying

396
00:31:16,800 --> 00:31:19,600
-That won't do, Your Highness
-I'll be fine

397
00:31:19,600 --> 00:31:23,000
-Go on!
-That's not a good idea

398
00:31:23,000 --> 00:31:25,000
-Go back
-All right

399
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:32,000
Bad news!

400
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:35,200
-What happened?
-I've lost Her Highness

401
00:31:35,400 --> 00:31:38,000
She's disappeared?
Wasn't she with you?

402
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:40,600
I waited a long time outside for her

403
00:31:40,600 --> 00:31:43,200
She was nowhere in sight
when I went in

404
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:46,000
Wait here for Her Highness.
The rest of you will come with me

405
00:31:46,600 --> 00:31:49,000
Your Highness!

406
00:31:55,000 --> 00:31:57,800
Your Highness!

407
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:01,600
Your Highness!

408
00:32:03,400 --> 00:32:05,400
Let's look for her separately

409
00:32:07,400 --> 00:32:08,600
Your Highness!

410
00:32:14,400 --> 00:32:15,600
Your Highness!

411
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:19,120
Your Highness!

412
00:32:27,400 --> 00:32:30,000
-Is Your Highness all right?
-I'm fine

413
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:31,600
I'm having fun

414
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:35,000
This is fun!

415
00:32:37,200 --> 00:32:40,000
Stop it! Any idea
I was worried sick about you?

416
00:32:40,600 --> 00:32:42,600
I looked for you everywhere

417
00:32:42,600 --> 00:32:44,200
I'm sorry

418
00:32:46,880 --> 00:32:48,600
Xiaotian!

419
00:32:50,400 --> 00:32:54,200
What's wrong? Are you angry?

420
00:32:54,200 --> 00:32:56,120
Be angry no more

421
00:32:58,000 --> 00:33:01,600
Your Highness, I'm escorting you
to a foreign land

422
00:33:01,600 --> 00:33:03,400
We're not on some sightseeing tour

423
00:33:03,400 --> 00:33:06,600
When I learnt you'd gone missing,
I was so worried

424
00:33:06,800 --> 00:33:10,000
How would I answer to your father
if you met with a mishap?

425
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:13,600
I'm sorry. It's all my fault.
Be angry no more

426
00:33:14,400 --> 00:33:17,400
Please don't play such pranks again

427
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:20,600
Sure. Xiaotian, will you
give me a smile?

428
00:33:20,800 --> 00:33:23,080
You look awful when you're angry

429
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:27,400
You're annoying

430
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:32,000
What would you do
if I really met with a mishap?

431
00:33:32,000 --> 00:33:33,400
Don't spout nonsense!

432
00:33:34,400 --> 00:33:38,400
Should you meet with a mishap,
I won't wish to live either

433
00:33:38,600 --> 00:33:40,400
Cross your heart?

434
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:46,600
You're the woman I love the most
in this world

435
00:33:46,600 --> 00:33:48,600
Should you meet with a mishap,

436
00:33:48,600 --> 00:33:51,400
life would lose its meaning for me

437
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:54,600
Xiaotian, you're so good to me

438
00:33:54,600 --> 00:33:57,400
I shan't be so wilful again

439
00:34:26,400 --> 00:34:29,400
I doubt they're still giving chase.
Shuangxi, are you tired?

440
00:34:29,600 --> 00:34:34,400
-I'm fine
-I'm sorry. I got you into this

441
00:34:34,880 --> 00:34:38,000
Brother Fuqi, stop apologizing to me

442
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:41,600
I've no one else to depend on now.
Please don't abandon me

443
00:34:49,000 --> 00:34:53,000
Rest assured
we'll never be apart again

444
00:34:57,400 --> 00:35:00,000
How touching!

445
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:04,400
Fine, I shall grant you your wish
to stay together in the netherworld!

446
00:35:07,600 --> 00:35:10,600
Shuangxi, run.
I'll deal with him

447
00:35:10,600 --> 00:35:13,000
I'm not leaving.
If we must die, we'll die together

448
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:14,400
Shuangxi!

449
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:20,400
What a moving scene! But none of you
shall escape my clutches today

450
00:35:21,800 --> 00:35:23,600
How boastful!

451
00:35:23,600 --> 00:35:27,000
You call yourself Lord Iron-arm.
Well, I'm Invincible Iron-arm!

452
00:35:27,400 --> 00:35:31,000
You don't know what you're in for.
You shall have a taste of my prowess

453
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:35,000
I'm so scared!
Yeah, right!

454
00:35:35,400 --> 00:35:37,400
If you were really that good,

455
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:40,000
you wouldn't have lost to my buddy,
Mei Shouquan

456
00:35:40,400 --> 00:35:42,000
That was a slip-up

457
00:35:42,400 --> 00:35:45,000
Like I care!

458
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:49,600
I dare you to take three blows
from me or make yourself scarce!

459
00:35:49,600 --> 00:35:54,000
Stop calling yourself Lord Iron-arm.
You're embarrassing yourself

460
00:35:54,600 --> 00:35:58,600
If I can't kill you in three blows,
I shall let both of you off

461
00:35:58,600 --> 00:36:01,600
I'll hold you to that!
Don't you back out

462
00:36:01,600 --> 00:36:03,400
Brother Fuqi, no

463
00:36:03,600 --> 00:36:06,600
He's just making an empty show of
strength. I'll be fine

464
00:36:06,600 --> 00:36:09,000
Seize the chance to make your escape

465
00:36:10,400 --> 00:36:11,600
You're on!

466
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:17,000
Brother Fuqi!

467
00:36:17,400 --> 00:36:20,200
Is that all you can do?

468
00:36:21,200 --> 00:36:24,400
I only executed three-tenths of
my power. Here's my second blow!

469
00:36:30,600 --> 00:36:32,600
Brother Fuqi!

470
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:37,000
-Are you all right? End the duel
-There is one more blow to go

471
00:36:37,400 --> 00:36:39,400
Don't forget what you promised

472
00:36:39,400 --> 00:36:42,400
You said you'd let us off
if you couldn't defeat me

473
00:36:42,600 --> 00:36:46,600
You've got spunk! I'd have loved
to take you as my disciple

474
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:50,400
But you don't have that good fortune.
Meet your doom!

475
00:37:01,800 --> 00:37:05,000
-Brother Fuqi, are you all right?
-Shuangxi, run!

476
00:37:06,400 --> 00:37:07,400
Run!

477
00:37:09,800 --> 00:37:11,000
Stay right there!

478
00:37:25,120 --> 00:37:28,400
Yu Shuangxi, I'll hunt you down
to the ends of the earth!

479
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:32,000
What are you doing?
You can't take that away

480
00:38:35,400 --> 00:38:38,000
You can't take that away!

481
00:38:38,000 --> 00:38:39,000
Rascal!

482
00:38:41,800 --> 00:38:44,400
Sir, here's the money

483
00:38:45,400 --> 00:38:50,600
Sir, my son has a kind heart. He has
nothing to do with the incident

484
00:38:50,600 --> 00:38:53,600
Say no more. I take it that
he's absconded to avoid punishment

485
00:38:54,600 --> 00:38:59,000
-Have you searched the place?
-You can't take that away

486
00:38:59,000 --> 00:39:01,000
Let's go.
See you tomorrow

487
00:39:03,400 --> 00:39:06,400
That's my money!

488
00:39:06,600 --> 00:39:10,000
Come back!
You're no better than robbers!

489
00:39:10,000 --> 00:39:12,400
They're gone. Stop shouting

490
00:39:12,600 --> 00:39:17,000
-Let's clear the mess
-What's there to clear?

491
00:39:17,400 --> 00:39:20,400
They're gone
only to come back tomorrow

492
00:39:20,800 --> 00:39:25,000
They're here once a day and
each time, they come like a typhoon

493
00:39:25,000 --> 00:39:26,400
What are we to do?

494
00:39:26,600 --> 00:39:31,600
Ma Ruyi is to blame!
She's trouble. A jinx!

495
00:39:31,600 --> 00:39:36,000
She's gone away,
leaving us behind to suffer...

496
00:39:43,400 --> 00:39:45,400
The guards are gone

497
00:39:46,400 --> 00:39:50,600
They come here every day.
We can't go on hiding like this

498
00:39:54,400 --> 00:39:56,400
What shall we do?

499
00:39:56,400 --> 00:39:59,200
I plan to look Lu and
Her Highness up in the Capital

500
00:39:59,200 --> 00:40:01,000
They may be able to help us

501
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:03,600
Let's be on our way

502
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:07,000
You're coming along?
No, I can't implicate you

503
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:10,000
Why stand on ceremony with me?
We can look out for each other

504
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:11,000
Let's go

505
00:40:13,800 --> 00:40:15,000
Ma Ruyi!

506
00:40:17,600 --> 00:40:19,000
Ma Ruyi

507
00:40:20,400 --> 00:40:23,400
While we live in fear,
you stay in hiding here

508
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:26,600
Those guards have removed things
from our house, including my "ruyi"!

509
00:40:26,600 --> 00:40:29,600
Not so loud!
Our neighbours can hear you

510
00:40:30,120 --> 00:40:33,000
Why should I worry?
Those guards aren't after my head

511
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:35,800
It's Ma Ruyi they're after!

512
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:40,400
Sis, not so loud!
Ma Ruyi is a wanted person

513
00:40:40,400 --> 00:40:43,400
If you're found harbouring her,
you'll get beheaded

514
00:40:45,400 --> 00:40:48,000
Brother, what have you been up to?

515
00:40:49,000 --> 00:40:51,000
Why is the yamen after you?

516
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:54,000
You wouldn't understand anyway.
It's a long story

517
00:40:54,000 --> 00:40:57,880
We were just thinking of places
to go into hiding when you barged in

518
00:40:58,000 --> 00:41:01,120
Get this straight.
Just don't get us into trouble

519
00:41:03,200 --> 00:41:07,200
Brother, think of a way
to dump that Ma Ruyi

520
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:09,400
All right. I know what I'm doing

521
00:41:09,400 --> 00:41:13,200
I'll be away for a few days.
Tell Mother not to worry

522
00:41:13,600 --> 00:41:19,000
I won't tell her a thing. I'll
pretend I've seen and heard nothing

523
00:41:31,600 --> 00:41:32,600
Don't worry

524
00:41:57,200 --> 00:41:58,200
Halt!

525
00:41:58,400 --> 00:42:00,200
Ma Ruyi, there is no escape for you

526
00:42:00,200 --> 00:42:02,600
Run, Ruyi!
I'll handle them

527
00:42:03,200 --> 00:42:06,000
-Stay right there!
-Run! Don't listen to him!

528
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:07,400
Stay right there!

529
00:42:07,600 --> 00:42:10,000
-Run! Ignore him!
-Stay right there!

530
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:11,400
Give chase!

531
00:42:11,400 --> 00:42:14,000
-Run!
-Stay right there!

532
00:42:15,720 --> 00:42:20,600
Ma Ruyi, you've become so obedient.
Make your way to the yamen

533
00:42:22,600 --> 00:42:25,000
Make your way there!

534
00:42:28,400 --> 00:42:30,600
I've brought Golden Swallow back

535
00:42:33,400 --> 00:42:40,400
Adviser Chen, you're something.
You've even subdued the No.1 Constable

536
00:42:40,600 --> 00:42:46,000
The Obedient Spell has turned
Golden Swallow into a toothless tiger

537
00:42:46,000 --> 00:42:47,800
She's worse than a sickly cat

538
00:42:48,400 --> 00:42:52,600
Adviser Chen, has Golden Swallow
truly become obedient and submissive?

539
00:42:52,600 --> 00:42:57,600
Indeed she has! How else did I bring
her back without any resistance?

540
00:43:05,400 --> 00:43:07,600
Come in, Ma Ruyi

541
00:43:08,400 --> 00:43:09,400
Here!

542
00:43:10,400 --> 00:43:14,000
-She's here, Your Excellency
-What do you want?

543
00:43:14,000 --> 00:43:17,200
Release Mei Shouquan
or I'll turn nasty

544
00:43:17,200 --> 00:43:20,400
-You said she'd be obedient
-It only lasts for a moment

545
00:43:21,200 --> 00:43:23,600
-I'll go find him!
-Stay right there!

546
00:43:23,600 --> 00:43:28,000
Turn around!
Your Excellency, I take my leave

547
00:43:28,000 --> 00:43:29,800
Enjoy yourself

548
00:43:30,800 --> 00:43:33,600
Ma Ruyi, wait on His Excellency

549
00:43:39,200 --> 00:43:41,200
Shi Yaoqian, how dare you
do this to me!

550
00:43:42,000 --> 00:43:46,600
Miss Ma, since Miss Yu Shuangxi
ran away on the wedding night,

551
00:43:46,600 --> 00:43:49,400
I've been having sleepless,
lonely nights

552
00:43:49,400 --> 00:43:53,000
-You should understand that
-What are you talking about?

553
00:43:53,000 --> 00:43:56,600
Miss Ma, though
I'm not very handsome,

554
00:43:56,600 --> 00:43:58,600
I have a very gentle heart

555
00:43:58,600 --> 00:44:04,600
If only you'd fill the void
in my heart and bring me delight

556
00:44:06,120 --> 00:44:08,000
-Shameless!
-Stop!

557
00:44:09,400 --> 00:44:13,000
Ma Ruyi, remove your clothes

558
00:44:15,000 --> 00:44:16,800
Help...!

559
00:44:18,000 --> 00:44:19,400
Subtitled by A Han


